#: ../../tools/pdbe_kb_tools.rst:94 8a02f9e800d24ddabf0ab88ebc4f0e0b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get aggregated structural summary statistics for a "
"UniProt protein from PDBe-KB. Returns the number of PDB structures, "
"unique ligands, interaction partners, annotations, and similar proteins "
"available for the protein. This is a quick way to assess structural "
"coverage before diving into detailed data. Example: P04637 (TP53) has 296"
" PDB structures, 121 ligands, and 54 interaction partners."
msgstr ""

